From d24d4bd562dfc9243cd57676cd8f36e179c58315 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 5656565566 <contact@home56.top>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 12:00:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] art: consolidate Floral NativeBridge routing and namespaces

Keep platform x86 libraries in the host namespace while retaining every app-private library of a bridged process in its selected guest namespace.

Link guest classloaders with Android public libraries without preloading backend runtime sonames. Add an opt-in, non-invasive namespace audit for exported handles, namespace topology, link ownership, and loader errors.

Change-Id: I02c375a10a2ff68e26d4ef83ac06924b691d1cc5
